{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["The sense of <b>and from there Be'erah</b> refers back to above (Numbers 21:14), to say that they encamped on the far side of the Arnon, and from there they journeyed and circled around to Be'erah, for they did not enter into the Arnon and proceed onward from it, since it is the border of the remaining Moab. And here Scripture gives the name of the place after the miracle, and its name is not as such in the itinerary list:"], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:07:21.490097349Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}